WEBVTT

00:00.000 --> 00:03.500
Define the style with representative samples.

00:03.500 --> 00:07.000
Share samples, rules and delivery requirements in one project pack.

00:07.000 --> 00:10.500
Give artists and agents the same direction for characters, scenes, objects and UI.

00:10.500 --> 00:14.500
Review the components together at game size.

00:14.500 --> 00:21.000
Check that actions, scene changes and effects belong to the same world.

00:21.000 --> 00:24.000
One team, one visual memory.
